      ],
      evolution: 'The game appears to have evolved within Afghan culture, with the Pakistani variant Ramchi developing among Afghan refugee communities. The partition game mechanic is similar to British Crash.',
      cultural: 'Chor Voli represents traditional Afghan card gaming culture. The game is played counterclockwise, following regional customs. It serves as entertainment and social bonding within Afghan communities.',
